title: AWS v2 RDS: Agent Jobs
agents: aws_v2
catalog: cloud/aws
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check monitors the failed SQL server agent jobs (Microsoft
 SQL servers only).

 To make this check work you have to configure the related
 special agent {Amazon Web Services (AWS) v2}.

 The service goes {WARN} if at least one jobs fails.

item:
 Name of the instance and region name (to avoid duplicate services
 in case of multi-region monitoring).

discovery:
 One service is created for each database if the required metrics
 (FailedSQLServerAgentJobsCount) are given.
